{"3887710": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "JellyFish", "steam_appid": 3887710, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JellyFish</strong> is a first-person multiplayer action game where the hot-tempered <strong>Gelava</strong> (Jellies) crank up the reactor’s heat while the stone-cold <strong>Koizo</strong> (Fish) scramble to cool it down. Up to 8 players dive into chaotic <strong>5-minute</strong> power struggles, twisting the environment to spring traps, block paths, and zip through the lab. Everyone’s made of glass, so expect plenty of cracks, shatters, and laughs as you play with friends in this high-pressure clash of Jelly and Fish.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JellyFish</strong> is a first-person multiplayer action game where the hot-tempered <strong>Gelava</strong> (Jellies) crank up the reactor’s heat while the stone-cold <strong>Koizo</strong> (Fish) scramble to cool it down. Up to 8 players dive into chaotic <strong>5-minute</strong> power struggles, twisting the environment to spring traps, block paths, and zip through the lab. Everyone’s made of glass, so expect plenty of cracks, shatters, and laughs as you play with friends in this high-pressure clash of Jelly and Fish.</p>", "short_description": "Keep it cool or raise the heat in this first-person, online, control point, party game with up to 8 players. The hot-tempered Gelava (Jellies) will crank up the reactor’s heat, while the stone-cold Koizo (Fish) scramble to cool it down. Which team are you picking?", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887710/a60cbedc4f5e25e1b216d0565af6c6b04c700d79/header.jpg?t=1768620170", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3887710/a445f473ade9c24091e9676ecc46c35a00976434/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768620170", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared